<title>UK: BayerVB sets 10 billion escudo 10-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 10 billion escudo 10-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTE    BASE	*6M-LISBOR MATURITY    25.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+20 BP    PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA1	 ISS PRICE  100.40    FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	*CAPPED AT 8.25 PCT, FLOOR OF 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
